<title>USA: Shoreline completes SJS merger.</title>
<headline>Shoreline completes SJS merger.</headline>
<dateline>BENTON HARBOR, Mich. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shoreline Financial Corp said it has completed its $25 million acquisition of SJS Bancorp Inc.</p>
<p>SJS, a holding company with $151 in assets at March 31, is the parent company of SJS Federal Savings Bank. Shoreline is a bank holding company with total assets of $737 million at March 31.</p>
<p>Under the deal, SJS shareholders receive $27 in cash for each share of SJS stock.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
